//@version=6
// SPX Pulse V13.22 — TradingView backtest port of SPX_Pulse_V13.ts
//
// APPLY TO: SP:SPX (or your broker's SPX), 3-minute chart, regular session,
// timezone America/New_York. Open the Strategy Tester tab for results; use
// "Deep Backtesting" (Premium) to extend history beyond the chart's bar limit.
//
// SOURCE OF TRUTH: SPX_Pulse_V13.ts in this repo. This port keeps the signal
// engine bar-for-bar faithful, with these DOCUMENTED divergences:
//   D1. 10-min confirmation EMAs come from true completed 10-minute bars
//       (request.security, no lookahead). thinkorswim evaluates them over
//       3-min chart bars of the developing 10-min series, which weakens the
//       filter; this port implements the documented intent.
//   D2. ADR14 / prior daily ATR are true 14-day aggregates of completed
//       sessions. The .ts versions average over 3-min bars of the DAY series
//       (a thinkscript mixed-aggregation quirk), so live values differ.
//   D3. VIX1D is actually requested here (the live feed lacks it, so the .ts
//       hardcodes NaN and falls back to VIX). Toggle with useVIX1DExpectedMove.
//   D4. Exits are executed as orders: half at +1R (limit, touch-based), stop
//       to breakeven, runner trails max(BE, EMA21 -/+ 0.25*tol) close-based,
//       runner target touch-based, 20-bar time stop on losers (close-based),
//       hard exit on the 15:30 bar. Stops are CLOSE-through-level, as in the
//       study's stopHit definition — not intrabar touch.
//   D5. One position at a time. A same-side signal while in a trade is
//       skipped (marked with a tiny triangle if Show skipped = on); an
//       opposite-side signal closes the open trade and reverses, mirroring
//       the study's activeSide overwrite.
//
// TRADE TAGS: every entry comment is "<C|P> <TAG> <REGIME> s<score> r<R>",
// e.g. "C ORB TU s83 r2.1". Export the trades list (Strategy Tester ->
// List of trades -> export) to analyze expectancy per tag x regime x score.
//
// WALK-FORWARD: set "Test window" = In-sample, tune inputs, then flip to
// Out-of-sample WITHOUT touching anything else and read the report.
//
// RESEARCH TOGGLES (added after the 2026-10-06 ten-year run, see
// backtest/REPORT-2026-10-06.md): "Stop mode: Touch" replaces the study's
// close-through stop with a real stop order; "Allow entries in UNDECIDED
// regime" off skips the PF-0.93 UNDECIDED cohort; "With-trend continuation
// only" restricts to TREND/ORB/MOMO/FLAG aligned with a confirmed trend
// regime. Defaults preserve study behavior.
// NOTE: Properties -> Default order size must be 2 for the scale-half to
// leave a runner; at size 1 the +1R scale closes the whole position.
strategy("SPX Pulse V13 Backtest", shorttitle = "PulseV13-BT", overlay = true,
     process_orders_on_close = true, calc_on_every_tick = false,
     default_qty_type = strategy.fixed, default_qty_value = 2, pyramiding = 0,
     initial_capital = 1000000, max_labels_count = 500)

// ---------------- Inputs (mirrors the .ts, plus backtest controls) --------
minimumScore       = input.int(70,  "Minimum score", minval = 0, maxval = 100)
timeStopBars       = input.int(20,  "Time stop (bars)", minval = 1)
minRewardRisk      = input.float(1.5, "Min reward:risk (0 = off)", step = 0.1)
signalCooldownBars = input.int(10,  "Signal cooldown (bars)", minval = 0)
useTenMinuteConfirmation = input.bool(true,  "10-min ribbon confirmation")
useVIXConfirmation       = input.bool(true,  "VIX gate (VIX vs 8-bar EMA)")
useVIX1DExpectedMove     = input.bool(true,  "Expected move from VIX1D (else VIX)")
useManualGEX  = input.bool(false, "Use manual GEX levels")
gammaFlip     = input.float(0.0, "Gamma flip")
callWall      = input.float(0.0, "Call wall")
putWall       = input.float(0.0, "Put wall")
overnightHigh = input.float(0.0, "Overnight high (manual)")
overnightLow  = input.float(0.0, "Overnight low (manual)")
manualSupport    = input.float(0.0, "Manual support")
manualResistance = input.float(0.0, "Manual resistance")

grpBT = "Backtest controls"
testWindow   = input.string("All", "Test window", options = ["All", "In-sample", "Out-of-sample"], group = grpBT)
splitDate    = input.time(timestamp("2025-12-01T00:00:00-05:00"), "In/out-of-sample split date", group = grpBT)
exitEngine   = input.string("Scale+Trail (V13)", "Exit engine", options = ["Scale+Trail (V13)", "Fixed target only"], group = grpBT,
     tooltip = "A/B for handoff question 6: V13 scale-half/trail vs plain stop-and-target")
targetMode   = input.string("Structure/EM (V13)", "Target mode", options = ["Structure/EM (V13)", "Fib 1.618R", "Fib 2.618R"], group = grpBT,
     tooltip = "V13 targets the nearest opposing level capped at +-1 EM. The Fib modes instead place the target at 1.618x or 2.618x the risk distance beyond entry - a test of whether farther mechanical targets capture more of the trend-day tail (the 2016-2026 run showed held-past-target trades kept paying). The R:R gate still uses the V13 structure target, so the signal set is IDENTICAL across modes - only the exit changes.")
stopMode     = input.string("Close through (V13)", "Stop mode", options = ["Close through (V13)", "Touch (intrabar)"], group = grpBT,
     tooltip = "The .ts stops on CLOSE through the level, which let 16% of trades in the 2016-2026 run lose >1.2x the avg win. Touch mode places a real stop order at the level instead (pre-1R; the post-1R runner still trails on close).")
allowUndecided = input.bool(true, "Allow entries in UNDECIDED regime", group = grpBT,
     tooltip = "2016-2026 run: UNDECIDED-regime trades were n=566, PF 0.93. Untick to skip them entirely instead of relying on the +5 score bump.")
withTrendOnly  = input.bool(false, "With-trend continuation only", group = grpBT,
     tooltip = "Only TREND/ORB/MOMO/FLAG entries aligned with a confirmed trend regime (calls in TREND UP, puts in TREND DOWN). Drops fades, breakouts, range- and counter-regime trades — the cells that bled in the 2016-2026 run.")
useLunchHaircut = input.bool(true, "12:00-13:00 score x0.85", group = grpBT)
undecidedBump   = input.int(5, "Score bump when regime UNDECIDED", group = grpBT)
emNoRoomCut     = input.float(0.85, "No room credit past this EM used", step = 0.05, group = grpBT)
emTrendCap      = input.float(1.0,  "Trend override allowed inside this EM", step = 0.05, group = grpBT)
wWithTrendIn    = input.int(30, "Setup wt: with-trend in trend regime", group = grpBT)
wCounterIn      = input.int(8,  "Setup wt: counter in trend regime", group = grpBT)
wWithTrendRange = input.int(10, "Setup wt: with-trend in range regime", group = grpBT)
wCounterRange   = input.int(30, "Setup wt: counter in range regime", group = grpBT)
wUndecided      = input.int(18, "Setup wt: any setup, regime undecided", group = grpBT)
showSkipped     = input.bool(false, "Mark skipped signals", group = grpBT)
showLevels      = input.bool(true,  "Plot OR / PDH / PDL / PDC", group = grpBT)

inWindow = testWindow == "All" ? true : testWindow == "In-sample" ? time < splitDate : time >= splitDate

// ---------------- Session clock (bar OPEN time, like SecondsFromTime) -----
tzNY = "America/New_York"
minsNY     = hour(time, tzNY) * 60 + minute(time, tzNY)
newSession = session.isfirstbar
inOR       = minsNY >= 570 and minsNY < 585          // 09:30-09:45
orComplete = minsNY >= 585
after1030  = minsNY >= 630
before1000 = minsNY < 600
before1200 = minsNY < 720
eligibleTime = minsNY >= 585 and minsNY < 915        // 09:45-15:15
lunch        = minsNY >= 720 and minsNY < 780        // 12:00-13:00
exitWindow   = minsNY >= 930                          // 15:30

// ---------------- Core series --------------------------------------------
phaseATR   = ta.rma(ta.tr, 14)
phasePivot = ta.ema(close, 21)
phaseRaw   = phaseATR != 0 ? ((close - phasePivot) / (3 * phaseATR)) * 100 : 0
phase      = ta.ema(phaseRaw, 3)
phaseSlope = phase - phase[1]
phaseBull  = phaseSlope > 0 and phase > -61.8
phaseBear  = phaseSlope < 0 and phase < 61.8
leavingDownExtreme = ta.crossover(phase, -61.8)
leavingUpExtreme   = ta.crossunder(phase, 61.8)

ema8   = ta.ema(close, 8)
ema13  = ta.ema(close, 13)
ema21v = ta.ema(close, 21)
ema48  = ta.ema(close, 48)
bullRibbon = ema8 > ema13 and ema13 > ema21v and ema21v > ema48
bearRibbon = ema8 < ema13 and ema13 < ema21v and ema21v < ema48

// Divergence D1: true completed 10-min EMAs, non-repainting.
e8_10  = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "10", ta.ema(close, 8)[1],  lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
e13_10 = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "10", ta.ema(close, 13)[1], lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
e21_10 = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "10", ta.ema(close, 21)[1], lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
e48_10 = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "10", ta.ema(close, 48)[1], lookahead = barmerge.lookahead_on)
bull10 = e8_10 > e13_10 and e13_10 > e21_10 and e21_10 > e48_10
bear10 = e8_10 < e13_10 and e13_10 < e21_10 and e21_10 < e48_10
bullRegimeTrend = bullRibbon and (not useTenMinuteConfirmation or bull10)
bearRegimeTrend = bearRibbon and (not useTenMinuteConfirmation or bear10)

// ---------------- Day-level state (no lookahead; prior-day = completed) ---
var float sessHigh = na
var float sessLow = na
var float dayOpen = na
var float closePrevSession = na   // yesterday's final close as of each session's first bar
var float pdh = na
var float pdl = na
var float pdc = na
var float adr14 = na
var float priorATR = na
var float wDayATR = na
var float[] dayRangesArr = array.new_float()

float sessHighPrev = sessHigh   // value as of previous bar (ToS sessionHigh[1])
float sessLowPrev  = sessLow

if newSession
    if not na(sessHigh)
        float dRange = sessHigh - sessLow
        float dTR = na(pdc) ? dRange : math.max(sessHigh - sessLow, math.max(math.abs(sessHigh - pdc), math.abs(sessLow - pdc)))
        array.push(dayRangesArr, dRange)
        if array.size(dayRangesArr) > 14
            array.shift(dayRangesArr)
        wDayATR := na(wDayATR) ? dTR : (wDayATR * 13 + dTR) / 14
        // prior-day levels roll over BEFORE today's trackers reset
        pdc := closePrevSession
        pdh := sessHigh
        pdl := sessLow
    adr14 := array.size(dayRangesArr) > 0 ? array.avg(dayRangesArr) : na
    priorATR := wDayATR
    sessHigh := high
    sessLow  := low
    dayOpen  := open
else
    sessHigh := math.max(nz(sessHigh, high), high)
    sessLow  := math.min(nz(sessLow, low), low)
closePrevSession := close   // updated after the day-roll above, so at each session's first bar it still held the prior session's final close

// Fallbacks mirroring the .ts NaN armor
float adr14f    = not na(adr14) and adr14 > 0 ? adr14 : nz(sessHighPrev - sessLowPrev, 0)
float priorATRf = not na(priorATR) and priorATR > 0 ? priorATR : 40 * phaseATR

tolerance = math.max(phaseATR * 0.12, 1.0)

// ---------------- Participation + VWAP proxy (SPX TWAP, per the .ts) ------
srcTypical = (high + low + close) / 3
var float cumPV = na
var float cumN = na
cumPV := newSession ? srcTypical : nz(cumPV) + srcTypical
cumN  := newSession ? 1 : nz(cumN) + 1
twapProxy = cumPV / cumN
aboveVWAPProxy = close >= twapProxy

// ---------------- VIX gate + expected move --------------------------------
vixClose = request.security("CBOE:VIX", timeframe.period, close, ignore_invalid_symbol = true)
vixMean  = ta.ema(nz(vixClose, 20), 8)
vixDataOK = not na(vixClose) and not na(vixMean)
vixCallOK = not useVIXConfirmation or not vixDataOK or vixClose <= vixMean
vixPutOK  = not useVIXConfirmation or not vixDataOK or vixClose >= vixMean

vix1dRaw  = request.security("CBOE:VIX1D", timeframe.period, close, ignore_invalid_symbol = true)
vix1dUsable = not na(vix1dRaw) and vix1dRaw > 0
vixUsable   = not na(vixClose) and vixClose > 0
vixForEM = useVIX1DExpectedMove and vix1dUsable ? vix1dRaw : vixUsable ? vixClose : 0
emPtsRaw = dayOpen * (vixForEM / 100) / math.sqrt(252)
emPts = na(emPtsRaw) or emPtsRaw <= 0 ? priorATRf * 0.5 : emPtsRaw
emUpper1 = dayOpen + emPts
emLower1 = dayOpen - emPts
emUsed = emPts > 0 ? (close - dayOpen) / emPts : 0
emUsed := na(emUsed) ? 0 : emUsed

// ---------------- Gap classifier ------------------------------------------
gapPts = dayOpen - pdc
gapPct = not na(pdc) and pdc > 0 ? 100 * gapPts / pdc : 0
gapUp    = gapPct >= 0.02
gapDown  = gapPct <= -0.02
gapAbs   = math.abs(gapPct)
gapMicro  = gapAbs < 0.20
gapMedium = gapAbs >= 0.20 and gapAbs <= 0.40
gapLarge  = gapAbs > 0.40
gapFillProgress = gapUp and gapPts != 0 ? math.min(1, math.max(0, (dayOpen - sessLow) / gapPts)) :
                  gapDown and gapPts != 0 ? math.min(1, math.max(0, (sessHigh - dayOpen) / (-gapPts))) : 1
gapFilled = (gapUp and sessLow <= pdc) or (gapDown and sessHigh >= pdc)
gapFadeAlive = not gapLarge and (gapUp or gapDown) and not gapFilled and (not after1030 or gapFillProgress >= 0.30)
gapAndGoUp   = gapLarge and gapUp and gapFillProgress < 0.30
gapAndGoDown = gapLarge and gapDown and gapFillProgress < 0.30

// ---------------- 15-minute opening range ---------------------------------
var float orHigh = na
var float orLow = na
if newSession
    orHigh := high
    orLow  := low
else if inOR
    orHigh := math.max(nz(orHigh, high), high)
    orLow  := math.min(nz(orLow, low), low)

orbBreakUp   = orComplete and close > orHigh and close[1] <= orHigh
orbBreakDown = orComplete and close < orLow and close[1] >= orLow
var bool brokeUpToday = false
var bool brokeDownToday = false
brokeUpToday   := newSession ? false : orbBreakUp ? true : brokeUpToday
brokeDownToday := newSession ? false : orbBreakDown ? true : brokeDownToday
orbRetestUp   = brokeUpToday and close > orHigh and low <= orHigh + tolerance and close > open
orbRetestDown = brokeDownToday and close < orLow and high >= orLow - tolerance and close < open
orbCallSetup = before1200 and (orbBreakUp or orbRetestUp)
orbPutSetup  = before1200 and (orbBreakDown or orbRetestDown)
orbPrimeTime = orComplete and before1000

// ---------------- Level stack + nearest S/R -------------------------------
pRange = pdh - pdl
camR3 = pdc + pRange * 1.1 / 4
camR4 = pdc + pRange * 1.1 / 2
camS3 = pdc - pRange * 1.1 / 4
camS4 = pdc - pRange * 1.1 / 2
fib382 = pdl + pRange * 0.382
fib500 = pdl + pRange * 0.500
fib618 = pdl + pRange * 0.618

belowOr(lvl, ref) => not na(lvl) and lvl > 0 and lvl < ref ? lvl : -999999.0
aboveOr(lvl, ref) => not na(lvl) and lvl > 0 and lvl > ref ? lvl : 999999.0
nsRaw = math.max(math.max(math.max(math.max(belowOr(pdl, close), belowOr(pdh, close)), math.max(belowOr(pdc, close), belowOr(camS3, close))),
         math.max(math.max(belowOr(camS4, close), belowOr(fib382, close)), math.max(belowOr(fib500, close), belowOr(fib618, close)))),
         math.max(math.max(belowOr(overnightLow, close), belowOr(overnightHigh, close)), math.max(belowOr(orLow, close), belowOr(manualSupport, close))))
nrRaw = math.min(math.min(math.min(math.min(aboveOr(pdl, close), aboveOr(pdh, close)), math.min(aboveOr(pdc, close), aboveOr(camR3, close))),
         math.min(math.min(aboveOr(camR4, close), aboveOr(fib382, close)), math.min(aboveOr(fib500, close), aboveOr(fib618, close)))),
         math.min(math.min(aboveOr(overnightLow, close), aboveOr(overnightHigh, close)), math.min(aboveOr(orHigh, close), aboveOr(manualResistance, close))))
nearestSupport    = nsRaw > -999999 ? nsRaw : close - priorATRf * 0.5
nearestResistance = nrRaw < 999999 ? nrRaw : close + priorATRf * 0.5

// ---------------- Flag detector -------------------------------------------
pole10Up = close - ta.lowest(low, 10)
pole10Dn = ta.highest(high, 10) - close
impulseUp = pole10Up >= 2 * phaseATR and close > open
impulseDn = pole10Dn >= 2 * phaseATR and close < open
var float poleTopRec = na
var float poleBotForUp = na
var float poleBotRec = na
var float poleTopForDn = na
var int barsSinceImpUp = 100000
var int barsSinceImpDn = 100000
poleTopRec   := impulseUp ? high : poleTopRec
poleBotForUp := impulseUp ? ta.lowest(low, 10) : poleBotForUp
poleBotRec   := impulseDn ? low : poleBotRec
poleTopForDn := impulseDn ? ta.highest(high, 10) : poleTopForDn
barsSinceImpUp := impulseUp ? 0 : barsSinceImpUp + 1
barsSinceImpDn := impulseDn ? 0 : barsSinceImpDn + 1
poleHtUp = poleTopRec - poleBotForUp
poleHtDn = poleTopForDn - poleBotRec
flagWindowUp = barsSinceImpUp >= 4 and barsSinceImpUp <= 15
flagWindowDn = barsSinceImpDn >= 4 and barsSinceImpDn <= 15
flagHoldsUp = flagWindowUp and ta.lowest(low, 4) > poleTopRec - 0.5 * poleHtUp and ta.highest(high, 4) - ta.lowest(low, 4) < 0.6 * poleHtUp
flagHoldsDn = flagWindowDn and ta.highest(high, 4) < poleBotRec + 0.5 * poleHtDn and ta.highest(high, 4) - ta.lowest(low, 4) < 0.6 * poleHtDn
flagCallSetup = flagHoldsUp[1] and close > ta.highest(high, 4)[1] and close > open
flagPutSetup  = flagHoldsDn[1] and close < ta.lowest(low, 4)[1] and close < open
flagCallTarget = ta.highest(high, 4)[1] + poleHtUp
flagPutTarget  = ta.lowest(low, 4)[1] - poleHtDn

// ---------------- Regime gate ----------------------------------------------
var float fhHigh = na
var float fhLow = na
if newSession
    fhHigh := high
    fhLow  := low
else if not after1030
    fhHigh := math.max(nz(fhHigh, high), high)
    fhLow  := math.min(nz(fhLow, low), low)
fhRangePctADR = adr14f > 0 ? (fhHigh - fhLow) / adr14f : 0
insidePriorRange = close < pdh and close > pdl
gexTrendy = useManualGEX and gammaFlip > 0 and close < gammaFlip
gexRangy  = useManualGEX and gammaFlip > 0 and close > gammaFlip

trendUpEvidence = (gapAndGoUp ? 2 : 0) + (after1030 and fhRangePctADR > 0.45 and close > orHigh ? 2 : 0) +
     (close > pdh ? 1 : 0) + (bullRegimeTrend ? 1 : 0) + (emUsed > 0.6 ? 1 : 0) + (gexTrendy and close > dayOpen ? 1 : 0)
trendDnEvidence = (gapAndGoDown ? 2 : 0) + (after1030 and fhRangePctADR > 0.45 and close < orLow ? 2 : 0) +
     (close < pdl ? 1 : 0) + (bearRegimeTrend ? 1 : 0) + (emUsed < -0.6 ? 1 : 0) + (gexTrendy and close < dayOpen ? 1 : 0)
rangeEvidence = (gapMicro ? 1 : 0) + (after1030 and adr14f > 0 and fhRangePctADR > 0 and fhRangePctADR < 0.35 ? 2 : 0) +
     (insidePriorRange ? 1 : 0) + (gexRangy ? 1 : 0) + (math.abs(emUsed) < 0.35 and after1030 ? 1 : 0)

regime = not orComplete ? 0 :
     trendUpEvidence >= 3 and trendUpEvidence > trendDnEvidence and trendUpEvidence >= rangeEvidence ? 1 :
     trendDnEvidence >= 3 and trendDnEvidence > trendUpEvidence and trendDnEvidence >= rangeEvidence ? 2 :
     rangeEvidence >= 3 ? 3 : 0

sessionMult = not eligibleTime ? 0.0 : lunch and useLunchHaircut ? 0.85 : 1.0
lockoutCondition = not eligibleTime

// ---------------- Setups ----------------------------------------------------
trendCall = bullRegimeTrend and phaseBull and aboveVWAPProxy and
     (low <= ema13 + tolerance or (regime == 1 and low <= ema8 + tolerance)) and close > ema8 and close > open
trendPut = bearRegimeTrend and phaseBear and not aboveVWAPProxy and
     (high >= ema13 - tolerance or (regime == 2 and high >= ema8 - tolerance)) and close < ema8 and close < open

nearSupport    = math.abs(low - nearestSupport) <= tolerance or low <= emLower1 + tolerance
nearResistance = math.abs(high - nearestResistance) <= tolerance or high >= emUpper1 - tolerance
reversalCall = nearSupport and close > nearestSupport and close > open and phaseSlope > 0 and (leavingDownExtreme or phase < -23.6)
reversalPut  = nearResistance and close < nearestResistance and close < open and phaseSlope < 0 and (leavingUpExtreme or phase > 23.6)

gapFadePut  = gapFadeAlive and gapUp and close < dayOpen and phaseSlope < 0 and close < open and not aboveVWAPProxy
gapFadeCall = gapFadeAlive and gapDown and close > dayOpen and phaseSlope > 0 and close > open and aboveVWAPProxy

compressed = 2 * ta.stdev(close, 21) <= 2 * phaseATR
rangeHigh10 = ta.highest(high, 10)[1]
rangeLow10  = ta.lowest(low, 10)[1]
breakoutCall = compressed[1] and close > rangeHigh10 and aboveVWAPProxy and phaseSlope > 0
breakoutPut  = compressed[1] and close < rangeLow10 and not aboveVWAPProxy and phaseSlope < 0

momoCall = orComplete and not na(sessHighPrev) and close > sessHighPrev and close > open and bullRibbon and phaseSlope > 0 and aboveVWAPProxy
momoPut  = orComplete and not na(sessLowPrev) and close < sessLowPrev and close < open and bearRibbon and phaseSlope < 0 and not aboveVWAPProxy

callCandidate = trendCall or reversalCall or breakoutCall or orbCallSetup or flagCallSetup or gapFadeCall or momoCall
putCandidate  = trendPut or reversalPut or breakoutPut or orbPutSetup or flagPutSetup or gapFadePut or momoPut

// ---------------- Regime-weighted scoring ----------------------------------
wTrendSetup = regime == 1 or regime == 2 ? wWithTrendIn : regime == 3 ? wWithTrendRange : wUndecided
wFadeSetup  = regime == 3 ? wCounterRange : regime == 1 or regime == 2 ? wCounterIn : wUndecided
orbBonus = orbPrimeTime ? 4 : 0

callSetupScore = math.min(30, math.max(math.max(math.max(trendCall or breakoutCall ? wTrendSetup : 0,
     momoCall ? math.max(0, wTrendSetup - 4) : 0), orbCallSetup ? math.min(30, wTrendSetup + orbBonus) : 0),
     math.max(flagCallSetup ? wTrendSetup : 0, reversalCall or gapFadeCall ? wFadeSetup : 0)))
putSetupScore = math.min(30, math.max(math.max(math.max(trendPut or breakoutPut ? wTrendSetup : 0,
     momoPut ? math.max(0, wTrendSetup - 4) : 0), orbPutSetup ? math.min(30, wTrendSetup + orbBonus) : 0),
     math.max(flagPutSetup ? wTrendSetup : 0, reversalPut or gapFadePut ? wFadeSetup : 0)))

callAlign = bullRegimeTrend and phaseBull ? 20 : bullRibbon and phaseSlope > 0 ? 12 : bullRibbon or phaseBull ? 6 : 0
putAlign  = bearRegimeTrend and phaseBear ? 20 : bearRibbon and phaseSlope < 0 ? 12 : bearRibbon or phaseBear ? 6 : 0
alignMult = regime == 3 ? 0.5 : 1.0

callLocation = aboveVWAPProxy and (math.abs(low - ema13) <= tolerance or math.abs(low - nearestSupport) <= tolerance) ? 15 :
     reversalCall or gapFadeCall ? 12 : aboveVWAPProxy ? 7 : 0
putLocation = not aboveVWAPProxy and (math.abs(high - ema13) <= tolerance or math.abs(high - nearestResistance) <= tolerance) ? 15 :
     reversalPut or gapFadePut ? 12 : not aboveVWAPProxy ? 7 : 0

participationScore = 7

callRoom = nearestResistance - close
putRoom  = close - nearestSupport
roomNeed = math.max(5, phaseATR * 1.5)
callRoomScore = regime == 1 and close >= sessHigh - tolerance and emUsed <= emTrendCap ? 10 :
     emUsed > emNoRoomCut ? 0 : callRoom >= roomNeed or emUsed < 0.35 ? 10 : callRoom >= roomNeed * 0.6 ? 5 : 0
putRoomScore = regime == 2 and close <= sessLow + tolerance and emUsed >= -emTrendCap ? 10 :
     emUsed < -emNoRoomCut ? 0 : putRoom >= roomNeed or emUsed > -0.35 ? 10 : putRoom >= roomNeed * 0.6 ? 5 : 0

callGEXScore = useManualGEX and gammaFlip > 0 and close > gammaFlip and callWall > close ? 5 : 0
putGEXScore  = useManualGEX and gammaFlip > 0 and close < gammaFlip and putWall > 0 and putWall < close ? 5 : 0
callVolScore = vixCallOK ? 10 : 0
putVolScore  = vixPutOK ? 10 : 0

callScore = math.round(sessionMult * (nz(callSetupScore) + nz(callAlign * alignMult) + nz(callLocation) + participationScore + nz(callRoomScore) + callGEXScore + callVolScore))
putScore  = math.round(sessionMult * (nz(putSetupScore) + nz(putAlign * alignMult) + nz(putLocation) + participationScore + nz(putRoomScore) + putGEXScore + putVolScore))

effMinScore = regime == 0 ? minimumScore + undecidedBump : minimumScore

// ---------------- Geometry gate ---------------------------------------------
callStopCalc = math.min(ta.lowest(low, 3), nearestSupport) - 0.25 * tolerance
putStopCalc  = math.max(ta.highest(high, 3), nearestResistance) + 0.25 * tolerance
callStopF = math.max(callStopCalc, close - 2.2 * phaseATR)
putStopF  = math.min(putStopCalc, close + 2.2 * phaseATR)
callTargetRaw = flagCallSetup ? math.min(flagCallTarget, emUpper1) : emUpper1 > close + tolerance ? math.min(nearestResistance, emUpper1) : nearestResistance
putTargetRaw  = flagPutSetup ? math.max(flagPutTarget, emLower1) : emLower1 < close - tolerance ? math.max(nearestSupport, emLower1) : nearestSupport
callTargetCalc = math.max(callTargetRaw, close + tolerance)
putTargetCalc  = math.min(putTargetRaw, close - tolerance)
callRR = close - callStopF > 0 ? (callTargetCalc - close) / (close - callStopF) : 0
putRR  = putStopF - close > 0 ? (close - putTargetCalc) / (putStopF - close) : 0
callRROK = minRewardRisk == 0 or nz(callRR) >= minRewardRisk
putRROK  = minRewardRisk == 0 or nz(putRR) >= minRewardRisk

// ---------------- Confirmation + cooldown -----------------------------------
confirmedCall = not lockoutCondition and nz(callCandidate[1] ? 1 : 0) == 1 and nz(callRROK[1] ? 1 : 0) == 1 and nz(callScore[1]) >= effMinScore and close > close[1]
confirmedPut  = not lockoutCondition and nz(putCandidate[1] ? 1 : 0) == 1 and nz(putRROK[1] ? 1 : 0) == 1 and nz(putScore[1]) >= effMinScore and close < close[1]
rawCall = confirmedCall and not confirmedCall[1]
rawPut  = confirmedPut and not confirmedPut[1]
var int sinceCall = 100000
var int sincePut  = 100000
sinceCall := rawCall and sinceCall >= signalCooldownBars ? 0 : sinceCall + 1
sincePut  := rawPut and sincePut >= signalCooldownBars ? 0 : sincePut + 1
tradeCall = rawCall and sinceCall == 0
tradePut  = rawPut and sincePut == 0

// Tag the signal with its setup (evaluated on the candidate bar, [1])
callTag = orbCallSetup[1] ? "ORB" : flagCallSetup[1] ? "FLAG" : reversalCall[1] ? "LVL" : gapFadeCall[1] ? "GAPFADE" : momoCall[1] and not trendCall[1] ? "MOMO" : breakoutCall[1] and not trendCall[1] ? "BRKOUT" : "TREND"
putTag  = orbPutSetup[1] ? "ORB" : flagPutSetup[1] ? "FLAG" : reversalPut[1] ? "LVL" : gapFadePut[1] ? "GAPFADE" : momoPut[1] and not trendPut[1] ? "MOMO" : breakoutPut[1] and not trendPut[1] ? "BRKOUT" : "TREND"
// Regime tag carries the raw vote counts (trendUp-trendDown-range) so exports
// can test sub-groups, e.g. whether UNDECIDED with a 2-0 directional lean pays.
regTag = (regime == 1 ? "TU" : regime == 2 ? "TD" : regime == 3 ? "RG" : "UN") +
     " v" + str.tostring(trendUpEvidence) + "-" + str.tostring(trendDnEvidence) + "-" + str.tostring(rangeEvidence)

// Entry filters (backtest research toggles; both default to study behavior)
trendTags(tag) => tag == "TREND" or tag == "ORB" or tag == "MOMO" or tag == "FLAG"
callEntryOK = (allowUndecided or regime != 0) and (not withTrendOnly or (regime == 1 and trendTags(callTag)))
putEntryOK  = (allowUndecided or regime != 0) and (not withTrendOnly or (regime == 2 and trendTags(putTag)))

// ---------------- Trade management (orders) ---------------------------------
var float heldStop = na
var float heldTarget = na
var float heldEntry = na
var float heldRisk = na
var bool hit1R = false
var int entryBar = na
inLong  = strategy.position_size > 0
inShort = strategy.position_size < 0

// Entries (and study-faithful reversal on opposite signal)
if tradeCall and inWindow and callEntryOK
    if inLong and showSkipped
        label.new(bar_index, low, "skip C", style = label.style_triangleup, size = size.tiny, color = color.new(color.aqua, 70))
    if not inLong
        strategy.entry("C", strategy.long, comment = "C " + callTag + " " + regTag + " s" + str.tostring(math.round(nz(callScore[1]))) + " r" + str.tostring(callRR[1], "#.#"))
        heldStop := callStopF
        heldEntry := close
        heldRisk := close - callStopF
        heldTarget := targetMode == "Fib 1.618R" ? close + 1.618 * heldRisk : targetMode == "Fib 2.618R" ? close + 2.618 * heldRisk : callTargetCalc
        hit1R := false
        entryBar := bar_index
if tradePut and inWindow and putEntryOK
    if inShort and showSkipped
        label.new(bar_index, high, "skip P", style = label.style_triangledown, size = size.tiny, color = color.new(color.fuchsia, 70))
    if not inShort
        strategy.entry("P", strategy.short, comment = "P " + putTag + " " + regTag + " s" + str.tostring(math.round(nz(putScore[1]))) + " r" + str.tostring(putRR[1], "#.#"))
        heldStop := putStopF
        heldEntry := close
        heldRisk := putStopF - close
        heldTarget := targetMode == "Fib 1.618R" ? close - 1.618 * heldRisk : targetMode == "Fib 2.618R" ? close - 2.618 * heldRisk : putTargetCalc
        hit1R := false
        entryBar := bar_index

// 1R detection: touch-based, like the study's hit1R (high/low vs entry +/- risk),
// starting the bar after entry. Works identically in both exit-engine modes.
useScaleTrail = exitEngine == "Scale+Trail (V13)"
barsInTrade = not na(entryBar) ? bar_index - entryBar : 0
if strategy.position_size != 0 and bar_index > entryBar and not hit1R
    if strategy.position_size > 0 and high >= heldEntry + heldRisk
        hit1R := true
    if strategy.position_size < 0 and low <= heldEntry - heldRisk
        hit1R := true

// Touch mode places a real stop order at heldStop. In scale mode it protects
// the whole position until +1R banks (then the runner trails on close, floor
// breakeven, so the hard stop is dropped); in fixed mode it stays on for the
// life of the trade. Close-through mode keeps the study's close-based stop.
touchStops = stopMode == "Touch (intrabar)"
if strategy.position_size != 0 and bar_index > entryBar
    if inLong
        float stopOrdL = touchStops and (not hit1R or not useScaleTrail) ? heldStop : na
        if useScaleTrail
            strategy.exit("tp1", from_entry = "C", qty_percent = 50, limit = heldEntry + heldRisk, stop = stopOrdL, comment_profit = "1R SCALE", comment_loss = "STOP")
        strategy.exit("tgt", from_entry = "C", limit = heldTarget, stop = stopOrdL, comment_profit = "TARGET", comment_loss = "STOP")
        trailLine = math.max(heldEntry, ema21v - 0.25 * tolerance)
        if exitWindow
            strategy.close("C", comment = "1530 EXIT")
        else if useScaleTrail and hit1R and close < trailLine
            strategy.close("C", comment = "TRAIL")
        else if not touchStops and not hit1R and close < heldStop
            strategy.close("C", comment = "STOP")
        else if not touchStops and hit1R and not useScaleTrail and close < heldStop
            strategy.close("C", comment = "STOP")
        else if not hit1R and barsInTrade >= timeStopBars
            strategy.close("C", comment = "TIMESTOP")
    if inShort
        float stopOrdS = touchStops and (not hit1R or not useScaleTrail) ? heldStop : na
        if useScaleTrail
            strategy.exit("tp1", from_entry = "P", qty_percent = 50, limit = heldEntry - heldRisk, stop = stopOrdS, comment_profit = "1R SCALE", comment_loss = "STOP")
        strategy.exit("tgt", from_entry = "P", limit = heldTarget, stop = stopOrdS, comment_profit = "TARGET", comment_loss = "STOP")
        trailLineS = math.min(heldEntry, ema21v + 0.25 * tolerance)
        if exitWindow
            strategy.close("P", comment = "1530 EXIT")
        else if useScaleTrail and hit1R and close > trailLineS
            strategy.close("P", comment = "TRAIL")
        else if not touchStops and not hit1R and close > heldStop
            strategy.close("P", comment = "STOP")
        else if not touchStops and hit1R and not useScaleTrail and close > heldStop
            strategy.close("P", comment = "STOP")
        else if not hit1R and barsInTrade >= timeStopBars
            strategy.close("P", comment = "TIMESTOP")

// ---------------- Reference plots -------------------------------------------
plot(showLevels and orComplete ? orHigh : na, "OR High", color.orange, 2, plot.style_linebr)
plot(showLevels and orComplete ? orLow : na, "OR Low", color.new(color.fuchsia, 20), 2, plot.style_linebr)
plot(showLevels ? pdh : na, "PDH", color.new(color.red, 40), 1, plot.style_linebr)
plot(showLevels ? pdl : na, "PDL", color.new(color.green, 40), 1, plot.style_linebr)
plot(showLevels ? pdc : na, "PDC", color.new(color.yellow, 30), 1, plot.style_linebr)
plot(strategy.position_size != 0 ? heldStop : na, "Stop", color.red, 1, plot.style_circles)
plot(strategy.position_size != 0 ? heldTarget : na, "Target", color.green, 1, plot.style_circles)
plotshape(tradeCall, "Call signal", shape.triangleup, location.belowbar, color.aqua, size = size.small)
plotshape(tradePut, "Put signal", shape.triangledown, location.abovebar, color.fuchsia, size = size.small)
